        "corrected_at": "2026-06-25T10:00:56.953777+00:00",
        "type": "correction",
        "reason": "Story [2026-06-25-002] states the U.S. 'warns against attempts to cross the strait without authorization,' implying the U.S. claims authority over the Strait of Hormuz. The new verified fact states the U.S. rejects ANY nation's claim over the strait, which directly contradicts the implication that the U.S. itself asserts such authority.",
